# Editing a task's text writes its mid-line tags after the text, and undo restores the original line exactly.
file <<END
- Call @phone mom about @due(2026-12-01) dinner
END
see Call mom about dinner
keys <Enter>
type  soon
keys <Esc>
see Call mom about dinner soon
keys z
quit
saved <<END
- Call @phone mom about @due(2026-12-01) dinner
END
